exports[`learner education journey, via rhx given: [case4] one course driven 1.1 → 5.2 through every real guard, as case=1 walks it when: [t0] each stone is passed through route.stone.set, each self-review promised when its guard holds then: every hold, the hasty promise refusal, and the accepted promise render as the snapshot shows: 2.2.greats.read held 1 1`] = `
"
🪨 run solid skill repo=bhrain/role=driver/skill=route.stone.set

🦉 the way speaks for itself

🗿 route.stone.set
   ├─ stone = 2.2.greats.read
   └─ passage = blocked (review.self required)

🌕 lets reflect
   │
   ├─ review.self 1/2
   │  ├─ slug = has-cited-every-kernel-to-a-page-read
   │  ├─ question all, especially yourself
   │  └─ see the guide below
   │
   ├─ stillness 🪷
   │  ├─
   │  │
   │  │  so it is. a chance to slow down, breathe, and see clearly.
   │  │
   │  │  self review time is a sanctuary. a gift. a luxury not always available.
   │  │
   │  │  it is not every day one has a quiet moment to take a slow,
   │  │  methodical, patient, and thorough review.
   │  │
   │  │  tea first. then, we proceed 🍵
   │  │
   │  └─
   │
   ├─ before you begin 🪷
   │  ├─
   │  │
   │  │  - clear your mind. this is dedicated review time.
   │  │  - open each artifact mentioned in the guide
   │  │  - read through them slowly, line by line
   │  │  - question every assumption made
   │  │  - look with fresh eyes, as if for the first time
   │  │
   │  └─
   │
   ├─ here's the guide
   │  ├─
   │  │
   │  │  for each kernel in .route/v$DATE.education.pursuit.mechanic.idempotency/2.courses.pursue.yield/course=1.idempotency/2.2.greats.read.yield.md: name the page you read it on.
   │  │    a kernel known only from a search summary or a secondhand blog is a pointer, not
   │  │    evidence. relabel it, or read the source.
   │  │
   │  └─
   │
   ├─ be here now 🪷
   │  ├─
   │  │
   │  │  refocus.
   │  │
   │  │  the review is the work.
   │  │  not a step to complete.
   │  │  not a gate to pass.
   │  │  not a checkbox to check.
   │  │
   │  │  it is the work itself.
   │  │
   │  │  you do not care about the stone.
   │  │  you only care about the review.
   │  │
   │  └─
   │
   ├─ walk the way 🪷
   │  │
   │  ├─ articulate into
   │  │  ├─ .route/v$DATE.education.pursuit.mechanic.idempotency/2.courses.pursue.yield/course=1.idempotency/review/self/for.2.2.greats.read._.has-cited-every-kernel-to-a-page-read.md
   │  │  └─ the guard looks precisely here, write exactly to this path
   │  │
   │  ├─ for each found issue 🪘
   │  │  ├─
   │  │  │
   │  │  │  articulate how it was fixed
   │  │  │  so you remember for next time
   │  │  │
   │  │  └─
   │  │
   │  └─ for each non issue 🪘
   │     ├─
   │     │
   │     │  articulate why it holds
   │     │  so others can learn from it
   │     │
   │     └─
   │
   └─ when you've truly reflected, run
      └─ rhx route.stone.set --stone 2.2.greats.read --as promised --that has-cited-every-kernel-to-a-page-read \\
         --into .route/v$DATE.education.pursuit.mechanic.idempotency/2.courses.pursue.yield/course=1.idempotency/review/self/for.2.2.greats.read._.has-cited-every-kernel-to-a-page-read.md
"
`;

